  "contract": [
    "Imposing Combo 285598 reads 'Empowers these abilities to now consume combo points, ... granting you a buff for 2 seconds plus an additional 2 seconds per combo point: Divine Storm increases your armor by $285603s1%'.",
    "Helper 285599 (Divine Storm class mask, family 10 flags[1] 0x20000) procs Imposing Divinity 285603 (MOD_RESISTANCE_PCT armor 24+1 = 25%, SpellDuration 2000..12000 ms) and Clear Combo Points 283170. Nothing applied the helper, it had no spell_proc row and 283170 was a bare dummy, so Divine Storm neither spent points nor buffed.",
    "Expected with two combo points: Divine Storm grants Imposing Divinity for 2 s + 2 x 2 s = 6 s at 25% armor and leaves no combo points.",
    "The buff procs once per cast on a successful hit against the enemy holding the combo points: a single-target Stormstrike on another enemy neither grants Imposing Storm nor spends those points (Divine Storm is an area attack and also hits the combo target, so it cannot show this)."
  ],
